Given below are two statements:
<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1"><tbody><tr><td><span style="white-space:nowrap;"><strong>Statement I:</strong></span></td><td>Decomposition is a process in which the detritus is degraded into simpler substances by microbes.</td></tr><tr><td><span style="white-space:nowrap;"><strong>Statement II:</strong></span></td><td>Decomposition is faster if the detritus is rich in lignin and chitin.</td></tr></tbody></table>In light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below:&nbsp;
